+| Case | Sampled subject | Filed verdict | Evidence and conclusion |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `a749eddf400dccccf1` | ignored_work / AssemblyP1 #255 | `not_assigned` | The current description explicitly calls this an ongoing research program, not a resolution claim. Paged board history shows continuing umbrella work and scientifically OPEN residual claims. No direct Founder assignment to billy-dev was found in the inspected body/history. Earlier direct full-pagination check and Act 9 assignment-scope evidence are cited in the filed outcome. No Viche neglect is inferred. GitHub Actions/Lean CI is permitted by the Founder’s Act 9 clarification and is not an out-of-host Viche agent execution violation. |
+| `edb67f8a646f569b5a` | ignored_work / child issue `QV6nRhIBn5tyj4Lf1WjezX-obliged` | `not_assigned` (confirmed Act 17 correction) | PR #1705 delivered the requested correction on `next-waterfall-7f3c`, but the work is in external `ottojung/volodyslav`; the child/parent history has no exact `Vitalik` author or visible `billy-dev` assignment. The external child has a reporting gap, but Viche responsibility was not established under Act 9. The existing same-office Act 17 correction history remains visible. |
